{"id":"pcjezlg4wqxnmuno59foud3xj","title":"遗传背景影响 Cory's 海燕迁徙路线","originalTitle":"Genetic ancestry plays a key role in the migration of Cory's shearwaters","summary":"研究发现，Cory's 海燕的迁徙策略与其遗传背景密切相关，而非仅受繁殖地社会环境影响。地中海 Cory's 海燕与大西洋 Cory's 海燕杂交个体的迁徙路径介于两者之间，表明这些物种的长距离迁徙具有遗传基础。研究强调在保护策略中考虑杂交区和基因流的重要性。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"Phys.org"},"links":{"original":"https://phys.org/news/2026-11-genetic-ancestry-plays-key-role.html"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-11T01:00:01.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-11T01:15:33.954Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-11T01:15:33.954Z","category":"life-science","tags":["研究成果","基因治疗"],"score":36,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":{"publicId":"cfd16f78-7068-436e-a500-38e1da9f3161","title":"Cory's海燕迁徙遗传机制研究发布"},"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[{"publicId":"cfd16f78-7068-436e-a500-38e1da9f3161","title":"Cory's海燕迁徙遗传机制研究发布"}],"topics":[{"slug":"gene-editing","name":"基因编辑与 CRISPR"}],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":{"factId":"fgp5lL95T2Ac","reportCount":1,"additionalSourceCount":0},"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}